---
import "../styles/global.css";
import "../styles/layout.css";
import "../styles/components.css";
import "../styles/responsive.css";
---

<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <meta charset="utf-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
    <title>Terms & Conditions | Convertly</title>
    <meta
      name="description"
      content="Review the terms and conditions for using Convertly's USD to INR converter and its live exchange-rate tools."
    />
    <meta name="theme-color" content="#fafafa" media="(prefers-color-scheme: light)" />
    <meta name="theme-color" content="#0a0a0a" media="(prefers-color-scheme: dark)" />
    <link rel="canonical" href="https://convertly.app/terms-and-conditions" />
  </head>
  <body>
    <main class="legal-page">
      <div class="legal-shell">
        <a href="/" class="back-link">← Back to converter</a>
        <article class="legal-card">
          <p class="eyebrow">Terms & conditions</p>
          <h1>Terms & Conditions</h1>

          <p>By using Convertly, you agree to the following:</p>

          <ol>
            <li>The website provides a currency conversion tool for informational purposes only.</li>
            <li>Exchange rates may change frequently and may not reflect exact rates offered by banks or money exchangers.</li>
            <li>We do not guarantee that the displayed rate is final or suitable for legal, financial, tax, or accounting decisions.</li>
            <li>Use of the calculator does not create any financial or legal obligation.</li>
            <li>We may update features, pricing, or information at any time without notice.</li>
            <li>Content and tools are provided “as is” without warranties of any kind.</li>
          </ol>

          <p>
            We do our best to keep data accurate and up to date, but the final rates used by financial
            institutions may differ.
          </p>

          <p>By continuing to use the website, you accept these conditions.</p>
        </article>
      </div>
    </main>
  </body>
</html>
